From 244fefc20a00e67bc8ed11f2fa64b57ff2dcf205 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hanna Czenczek <hreitz@redhat.com>
Date: Fri, 30 May 2025 10:44:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] qcow2: Simplify size round-up in co_create_opts

RH-Author: Hanna Czenczek <hreitz@redhat.com>
RH-MergeRequest: 577: qcow2: Add keep_data_file command-line option
RH-Jira: RHEL-164549
RH-Acked-by: Kevin Wolf <kwolf@redhat.com>
RH-Acked-by: Stefan Hajnoczi <stefanha@redhat.com>
RH-Commit: [2/4] d84a2de383fa3570b086e8ca9fd74b066e1d5459

Use the now-existing qcow2_opts pointer to simplify the size rounding up
code.

Signed-off-by: Hanna Czenczek <hreitz@redhat.com>
Message-ID: <20250530084448.192369-3-hreitz@redhat.com>
Reviewed-by: Eric Blake <eblake@redhat.com>
Reviewed-by: Kevin Wolf <kwolf@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Kevin Wolf <kwolf@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 695d481a12a1190e1dd71761f0393047f6e16932)
Signed-off-by: Hanna Czenczek <hreitz@redhat.com>
---
 block/qcow2.c | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/block/qcow2.c b/block/qcow2.c
index cd7a1959c8..52e283f1dd 100644
--- a/block/qcow2.c
+++ b/block/qcow2.c
@@ -4156,8 +4156,7 @@ qcow2_co_create_opts(BlockDriver *drv, const char *filename, QemuOpts *opts,
     }
 
     /* Silently round up size */
-    create_options->u.qcow2.size = ROUND_UP(create_options->u.qcow2.size,
-                                            BDRV_SECTOR_SIZE);
+    qcow2_opts->size = ROUND_UP(qcow2_opts->size, BDRV_SECTOR_SIZE);
 
     /* Create the qcow2 image (format layer) */
     ret = qcow2_co_create(create_options, errp);
-- 
2.52.0

